#. type: Title ##
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Qiskit Runtime limitations {#qiskit-runtime-limitations}"
msgid "Quantum Compute limitations {#quantum-compute-limitations}"
msgstr "Mga limitasyon ng Qiskit Runtime {#qiskit-runtime-limitations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Support for `stretch` in Qiskit Runtime is currently experimental and has the following constraints:\n"
msgid "Support for `stretch` in Quantum Compute is currently experimental and has the following constraints:\n"
msgstr "Ang suporta para sa `stretch` sa Qiskit Runtime ay experimental pa lang at may mga sumusunod na hadlang:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- At most one stretch variable per _qubit set_ between barriers (implicit and explicit). A qubit set is one or more qubits; these sets must be mutually exclusive.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Hindi hihigit sa isang stretch variable bawat _qubit set_ sa pagitan ng mga barrier (implicit at explicit). Ang isang qubit set ay isa o higit pang mga qubit; ang mga set na ito ay dapat na magkahiwalay.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Hindi valid\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q0)  # Invalid because 2 stretches are applied on q0\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q0)  # Invalid because 2 stretches are applied on q0\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q2)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q2)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- The area surrounded by a set of barriers is called a _barrier region_. A stretch variable cannot be used in multiple barrier regions.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Ang lugar na napapalibutan ng isang set ng mga barrier ay tinatawag na _barrier region_. Hindi maaaring gamitin ang stretch variable sa maraming barrier region.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Hindi valid\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used in two barrier regions\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"         ```\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used in two barrier regions\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"         ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        ![Illustration of the previous code output](/docs/images/guides/stretch/bad-barrier-region.svg 'Invalid use of stretch in barrier regions')\n"
msgstr "        ![Ilustrasyon ng output ng nakaraang code](/docs/images/guides/stretch/bad-barrier-region.svg 'Hindi valid na paggamit ng stretch sa mga barrier region')\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used inside a barrier region that is on q0 and q1\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier(q2)\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        ```\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used inside a barrier region that is on q0 and q1\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier(q2)\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        ![Illustration of the previous code output](/docs/images/guides/stretch/good-barrier-region.svg 'Valid use of stretch in a barrier region')\n"
msgstr "        ![Ilustrasyon ng output ng nakaraang code](/docs/images/guides/stretch/good-barrier-region.svg 'Valid na paggamit ng stretch sa isang barrier region')\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Stretch expressions are limited to those of the form `X*stretch + Y` where `X` and `Y` are floating point or integer constants.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Ang mga stretch expression ay limitado sa mga may anyo na `X*stretch + Y` kung saan ang `X` at `Y` ay mga floating point o integer constant.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Hindi valid\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        c = circuit.add_stretch(\"c\")\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        c = circuit.add_stretch(\"c\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        # (a /  b) * c is not supported\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.mul(expr.div(a, b), c), q1)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        # (a /  b) * c is not supported\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.mul(expr.div(a, b), c), q1)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        from qiskit.circuit import Duration\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        from qiskit.circuit import Duration\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(expr.mul(a, 2), Duration.dt(3)), 0)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(expr.mul(a, 2), Duration.dt(3)), 0)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Stretch expressions can only include a single stretch variable.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"        <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Ang mga stretch expression ay maaari lamang maglaman ng iisang stretch variable.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"        <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Hindi valid\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(a, b), 0)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(a, b), 0)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(a, a), 0)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(a, a), 0)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    </Tabs>\n"
msgstr "    </Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Stretch expressions cannot resolve to negative delay values. The current solver doesn't infer non-negativity constraints.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Hindi maaaring mag-resolve ang mga stretch expression sa mga negatibong delay value. Ang kasalukuyang solver ay hindi nagpapataw ng mga hadlang sa hindi-negatibidad.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Hindi valid\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(20, q1)\n"
"        # The length of this barrier region is 20dt, meaning the\n"
